{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["腰帶的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說：「你去買一條麻布腰帶束在腰間，不可讓它沾水。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我照耶和華的話買了腰帶，束在腰間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華又對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「拿著你買來的腰帶去幼發拉底河邊，把它藏在那裡的巖縫中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，我照耶和華的吩咐把腰帶藏在那裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["多日後，耶和華對我說：「去幼發拉底河邊取回我吩咐你藏在那裡的腰帶。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我就去幼發拉底河邊把所藏的腰帶挖出來，但腰帶已經腐爛，毫無用處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「耶和華如此說，『我也要這樣消滅猶大的驕傲和耶路撒冷的狂妄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["這邪惡的百姓拒絕聽我的話，一意孤行，跟隨、供奉、祭拜其他神明，他們將像這腰帶一樣毫無用處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我本想使以色列人和猶大人緊靠著我，就像腰帶緊貼在人的腰間，讓他們做我的子民，使我聲名遠揚、得到讚美和尊崇，他們卻不肯聽從。這是耶和華說的。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「因此，你告訴他們，以色列的上帝耶和華說，『每個瓦瓶都要盛滿酒。』若他們說，『難道我們不知道每個瓦瓶都要盛滿酒嗎？』"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你就告訴他們，『耶和華說：我要使這片土地上所有的居民，包括坐在大衛寶座上的君王以及祭司、先知和耶路撒冷人都酩酊大醉；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我要使他們彼此撞得粉碎，就算父子也要彼此相撞；我要毀滅他們，決不留情，也不心慈手軟。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"你們要留心聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可傲慢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華已發言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趁著你們的上帝耶和華還未使黑暗來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們還未在漆黑的山上絆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把榮耀歸給祂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否則，祂必使你們期望的光明變為幽冥和黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們不肯聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心會為你們的驕傲暗自哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雙眼痛哭，淚流滿面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的羊群將要被擄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和華讓我對君王和太后說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「從寶座上下來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們頭上華美的王冠將要掉落。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"南部的城邑將被圍困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能解圍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人都要被擄，無一倖免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舉目看看那些從北方來的敵人吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前交託給你的群羊——你引以為榮的群羊如今在哪裡呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華讓你扶植的盟友來統治你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你還有什麼話可說？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像分娩的婦人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也許你在想：「為什麼這些事發生在我身上？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的裙子被撕破，你遭受蹂躪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因為你罪大惡極。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實人能改變他們的膚色嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子能改變牠們的斑點嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這作惡成性的人怎能行善呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要驅散你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像曠野的風吹散碎稭一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你應得的報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我量給你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你把我忘記，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠假神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要把你的裙子掀到你的臉上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人見到你的羞恥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在山上和田野間與偶像通姦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發出淫語浪聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見了你的可憎行為。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你什麼時候才肯自潔呢？」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}